{"timestamp": 1770349195421.5474, "start_timestamp": 1770349195418, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/status/commerce/user/info", "data": {"userId": 1615, "cardId": ""}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0e1NTRll2r8S7h4jHWll224CpS2NTRl5", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 1412cd445dd14d5096b265960c10d2e7"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770349195603, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"userId": "1615", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "ipArea": "上海市", "mobile": "17681122808", "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "nativePlace": {"provinceCode": "31", "province": "上海市", "cityCode": "3101", "city": "市辖区", "areaCode": "310120", "area": "奉贤区"}, "personalIntroduction": "我与时光共舞🌙，在晨曦微露到暮色四合间🌆，将每一个平凡的晨昏🎈，都酿成了心底温润的诗行。我以滚烫的热忱🏃‍♀️，作为生活的注脚，在每一次俯身耕耘、抬手播种中，聆听成长的足音💫，在每一次微小的拔节里👣，细品奋斗馈赠的甘饴🍯。\n\n生活的惊喜啊，总爱躲在某个转角🌸，等我们以虔诚的目光去发现，以温柔的双手去拾起✨。我欣悦于那种「破茧成蝶」的蜕变🌱，恰似种子顶开顽石，在一次次探索中汲取力量🌧️，在每一次蛰伏后绽放新的生机🌱。这份执着的热爱☀️，让步履愈发坚实，让心境愈发澄明。\n\n我怀揣着求知的星火🧠，在岁月的书页里孜孜不倦——每一次阅读都是与智者的对谈，每一次体验都是灵魂的拓荒?", "tag1": "上海福芮柚科技有限公司", "tag2": "测试", "wechat": "17681122808", "backUpUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/template/B-B8.png", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/stag/20251205/8c5377eea4f77e6b92207929d13a552f08e2d58145d7a6e04b4182f84ece5b39.jpg", "portraitUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/prod/portrait/20251130/3f67ba0bf35af9dec38ede306e0ecc3b933db966a7c6bb9404cd8bcfca8b9653.png", "nativePlaceName": ["上海市", "市辖区", "奉贤区"], "exchangeStatus": -1, "isMine": 1, "memberStatus": false, "templateId": "9", "styleId": "80", "shareId": "76", "cardIdentityType": 22, "currentIdentityId": "1967970973896331266", "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260206/5f4c6d34d94b8c26f38baad938268368cc75e09c